(Copilot Studio Agent Academy) Tj
T*
T*
(Welcome to Copilot Studio Agent Academy.) Tj
T*
T*
(Your mission should you choose to accept it is to master the art of building agents using) Tj
T*
(Microsoft Copilot Studio.) Tj
T*
T*
(This hands-on training is your entry point into the world of agents: from grounded prompts) Tj
T*
(to Adaptive Cards and agent flows, you'll learn how to build, scale, and deploy) Tj
T*
(intelligent agents using real-world tools and use cases.) Tj
T*
T*
(---) Tj
T*
T*
(  Rank Progression) Tj
T*
T*
(The Copilot Studio Agent Academy is a multi-phase training program designed to build your) Tj
T*
(skills across three agent ranks. Each level includes a badge and increasing) Tj
T*
(responsibilities:) Tj
T*
T*
(| Rank             | Level | Visual | |------------------|:-----:|--------| |  ) Tj
T*
(Recruit</br></br>  Get started \(https://aka.ms/agent-academy-recruit\){ .md-button) Tj
T*
(.md-button--primary }     |       | { width="300" }     | |   Operative</br>\(Coming Soon\)) Tj
T*
(|       | { width="300" } | |   Commander</br>\(Coming Soon\)    |       | { width="300" } |) Tj
T*
T*
