1 0 0 1 72 720 Tm
(- Understand what agents are in the context of Microsoft Copilot Studio) Tj
T*
(- Explore how Large Language Models \(LLMs\), retrieval-augmented generation \(RAG\), and) Tj
T*
(  orchestration come together in an agent) Tj
T*
(- Build both declarative and custom agents) Tj
T*
(- Enhance agents with Topics, Adaptive Cards, and Agent Flows) Tj
T*
(- Deploy agents to Microsoft Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot) Tj
T*
T*
(---) Tj
T*
T*
(  Prerequisites) Tj
T*
T*
(To complete all missions, you ll need:) Tj
T*
T*
(- A Microsoft 365 Developer tenant \(with SharePoint enabled\)) Tj
T*
(- Access to Microsoft Copilot Studio \(trial or licensed\)) Tj
