() Tj
T*
(  Mission Complete) Tj
T*
T*
(You ve now completed your introduction to agents and foundational AI concepts. You) Tj
T*
(understand:) Tj
T*
T*
(1. LLMs = The  Brain  of Your Agent) Tj
T*
(   - Responsible for language understanding and generation.) Tj
T*
(   - More tokens = richer context, but also higher cost per call.) Tj
T*
T*
(1. RAG = Real-Time Knowledge Integration) Tj
T*
(   - Bridges the gap between a static LLM and ever-changing data sources.) Tj
T*
(   - Retrieves and injects relevant documents or records into the LLM prompt.) Tj
T*
T*
(1. Conversational vs. Autonomous) Tj
T*
(   - Conversational: Focus on dialogue flow and preserving context \(e.g.,  Session) Tj
T*
