(How the Four Building Blocks Work Together) Tj
T*
T*
(When you assemble Knowledge, Tools, Topics, and Instructions, Copilot Studio s AI) Tj
T*
(orchestrator creates an agent that:) Tj
T*
T*
(1. Listens for a relevant Topic \(guided by your topic descriptions\).) Tj
