T*
(Knowledge: Query HR SharePoint list Agent-->>AI: PTO balance = 12 days AI->>Agent: Send) Tj
T*
(message to user \(Teams\) Note right of Agent: Action: Deliver notification Agent-->>User:) Tj
T*
("Your current PTO balance is 12 days.") Tj
