(purpose of a topic:) Tj
T*
T*
(- Informational - the user wants to know something) Tj
T*
(- Task completion - the user wants to do something) Tj
T*
(- Troubleshooting - the user needs help with resolving an issue) Tj
T*
T*
(   Step 3 - Map out the conversation) Tj
T*
T*
(Sketch a simple conversation flow of how the agent should respond) Tj
T*
T*
(- Start with a greeting or confirmation) Tj
T*
(- Ask follow-up questions to get details) Tj
T*
(- Provide answers or perform actions) Tj
