(  Mission 08: Enhance user interactions in Topics with Adaptive Cards) Tj
T*
T*
(      CODENAME: OPERATION INTERFACE UPLIFT) Tj
T*
T*
(>    Operation Time Window: ~45 minutes) Tj
T*
T*
(  Watch the Walkthrough) Tj
T*
T*
([]\(https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RhIlzYHPCXo "Watch the walkthrough on YouTube"\)) Tj
T*
T*
(   Mission Brief) Tj
T*
T*
(Agents, your mission is to infiltrate the static user experience and replace it with rich,) Tj
T*
(dynamic, and actionable Adaptive Cards. You ll deploy JSON payloads and Power Fx formulas) Tj
T*
(to transform Copilot Studio conversations from basic Q&A into fully interactive) Tj
T*
(engagements. Your goal is to gather user input, present data beautifully, and direct) Tj
T*
(conversations with precision and style. Fail to adapt, and your users may defect to less) Tj
T*
(intelligent interfaces.) Tj
T*
T*
(  Objectives) Tj
T*
T*
(In this mission, you ll learn:) Tj
T*
T*
