T*
(1. Smart logic) Tj
T*
(You can control what users see or interact with based on conditions, improving usability) Tj
T*
(and reducing errors.) Tj
T*
T*
(1. Low-code friendly) Tj
T*
(Power Fx is a low-code programming language. As mentioned earlier, it's readable,) Tj
T*
(intuitive and similar to Excel formulas.) Tj
