(In agent flows, instead of referencing data from cells in a table, you're referencing data) Tj
T*
(outputs from the trigger or actions when building your expressions. Continuing with the) Tj
T*
(previous example, use the function length to retrieve the number of items returned from) Tj
T*
(the Get items SharePoint connector action.) Tj
T*
T*
