T*
(  - Example: concat\('Hello ', firstName\)    Hello John ) Tj
T*
T*
(- toLower\(\) / toUpper\(\) - Changes text to lowercase or uppercase.) Tj
T*
(  - Useful for standardizing input.) Tj
