(  Mission Brief) Tj
T*
T*
(It's time to elevate your agent from conversational assistant to autonomous operative.) Tj
T*
(Your mission is to enable your agent to act without being summoned - responding to signals) Tj
T*
(from across your digital domain with precision and speed.) Tj
T*
T*
(With Event Triggers, you'll train your agent to monitor external systems like SharePoint,) Tj
T*
(Teams, and Outlook, and execute intelligent actions the moment a signal is received. This) Tj
T*
(operation transforms your agent into a fully operational field asset - silent, swift, and) Tj
T*
(always watching.) Tj
T*
T*
(Success means building agents that initiate value - not just respond to it.) Tj
T*
T*
(  Objectives) Tj
T*
T*
(  This lesson will cover:) Tj
T*
T*
(- Understanding Event Triggers and how they enable autonomous agent behavior) Tj
T*
(- Learning the difference between event triggers and topic triggers, including trigger) Tj
T*
(  workflows and payloads) Tj
T*
(- Exploring common Event Trigger scenarios) Tj
T*
(- Understanding authentication, security, and publishing considerations for event-driven) Tj
T*
(  agents) Tj
T*
(- Building an autonomous IT Help Desk agent that responds to SharePoint events and sends) Tj
T*
(  email acknowledgments) Tj
ET
