(  their daily workflow across Office applications.) Tj
T*
T*
(- Centralized Access: Instead of remembering separate websites or applications, users can) Tj
T*
(  access IT support through the platforms they're already using, reducing friction and) Tj
T*
(  increasing adoption.) Tj
T*
T*
(This mission transforms your development work into a production-ready solution that) Tj
T*
(delivers real value to your organization's end users.) Tj
T*
T*
(Prerequisites) Tj
T*
T*
(Before starting this lab, ensure you have:) Tj
T*
T*
(-   Completed previous labs and have a fully configured Contoso Helpdesk Agent) Tj
T*
(-   Your agent has been tested and is ready for production use) Tj
T*
