T*
(at the top of the agent overview.) Tj
T*
T*
(1. Select the Publish button in your agent) Tj
T*
(It opens the publish pop-up - to confirm you really want to publish your agent.) Tj
T*
T*
(1. Select Publish to confirm publishing your agent) Tj
T*
(Now a message shows that your agent is publishing. You don't have to keep that popup open.) Tj
T*
(You get notified when the agent is published.) Tj
T*
T*
(When the agent is done publishing, you see the notification at the top of the agent page.) Tj
