BT
/F1 12 Tf
14 TL
1 0 0 1 72 720 Tm
(Welcome, Recruit. Before you deploy your agents into the field, you need to know how usage) Tj
T*
(is measured, licensed, and billed. This mission breaks down the message-based billing) Tj
T*
(model, explains what Microsoft 365 Copilot licenses include, and shows you how to plan) Tj
T*
(with your estimator.) Tj
T*
T*
(---) Tj
T*
T*
(  Objective: Grasp the Message-Based Model) Tj
T*
T*
(Copilot Studio doesn t charge per user or per feature it bills you based on how many) Tj
T*
(messages your agents consume. A  message  is an interaction between your agent and the) Tj
T*
(user \(or a system\).) Tj
T*
T*
(-   Every user interaction with your agent counts as at least 1 message) Tj
T*
(-   Complex interactions \(like grounding, generative AI, or flows\) consume multiple) Tj
T*
(  messages) Tj
T*
(-   You pay for messages either via prepaid packs or pay-as-you-go \(PAYGO\)) Tj
T*
T*
(---) Tj
T*
T*
(Licensing Options) Tj
T*
T*
(1. Copilot Studio Message Packs) Tj
T*
T*
(- Prepaid tick-box: 25,000 messages/month for $200) Tj
T*
(- Best for predictable usage   capacity is pooled across the tenant) Tj
T*
T*
(2. Pay-As-You-Go \(PAYGO\)) Tj
T*
T*
(- Post-paid:  $0.01 per message) Tj
T*
(- No upfront commitment; usage is billed at month-end via Azure) Tj
T*
T*
(---) Tj
T*
T*
(What if you have M365 Copilot Licenses?) Tj
T*
T*
(If your team has Microsoft 365 Copilot licenses, your agents can run without additional) Tj
T*
(billing for key scenarios:) Tj
T*
T*
(- Classic answers, generative responses, graph-grounded messages, and basic agent actions) Tj
T*
(  are zero-rated for authenticated M365 Copilot users in apps like Teams and Outlook) Tj
T*
(- However: if you enable advanced features like autonomous triggers, agent flows beyond) Tj
T*
(  basic actions, or use external channels/APIs, those consume billable messages) Tj
T*
T*
(| Scenario                                     | Additional Messages Billed?) Tj
T*
(|) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
