T*
(| | Agent calling external API or flow         |   Billed \(5 + messages\)) Tj
T*
(| | Agent using autonomous trigger or grounding |   Billed) Tj
T*
(|) Tj
T*
T*
(---) Tj
T*
T*
(  Plan with Precision: Use the Estimator) Tj
T*
T*
(Before launching your agent, use our Copilot Studio Usage Estimator to forecast message) Tj
T*
(consumption under realistic scenarios:) Tj
T*
T*
(  Use the Copilot Studio Usage Estimator \(https://aka.ms/mcs-estimator\){ .md-button) Tj
T*
(.md-button--primary }) Tj
T*
T*
(It lets you:) Tj
T*
T*
(-   Specify your user count) Tj
T*
(-    Select agent features \(grounding, actions, flows, memory\)) Tj
T*
(-   Estimate total messages per agent per month) Tj
T*
(-   Optimize design and avoid billing surprises) Tj
T*
(  Run it early   and again after building   to compare expected vs. actual usage.) Tj
T*
T*
(---) Tj
T*
T*
(  Sample Scenario) Tj
T*
T*
(Environment: IT Help Desk agent with grounding + one Power Automate flow Sessions: 5 user) Tj
T*
(turns per session Assumptions: grounding \(10 msgs\) + action \(5 msgs\) + 5 generative) Tj
T*
(responses \(10 msgs\) Total: ~25 messages per session Scale: 500 sessions/month = ~12,500) Tj
T*
(messages \(  message pack\)) Tj
T*
T*
(---) Tj
T*
T*
(  Pro Tips for Cost Control) Tj
T*
T*
(- Monitor usage via Power Platform Admin Center) Tj
T*
(- Start in dev/test before going live) Tj
T*
(- Disable unused actions and connectors) Tj
T*
(- Use Microsoft 365 Copilot licenses when possible for internal use) Tj
T*
(- Use message packs when scale becomes predictable) Tj
T*
(- Use the Copilot Studio Usage Estimator to forecast usage) Tj
T*
T*
(---) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
